    "name": "Lucky Summoner",
    "steam_appid": 3568000,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Welcome to *Lucky Summoner*, a strategy card battle game that blends deck-building with RogueLite elements. Here, you'll play as a fledgling card summoner, skillfully utilizing the cards in your hand to defeat increasingly powerful enemies. Overcome the final BOSS's challenge to earn the title of Summoning Master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Introduction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568000/extras/591e7ad78b957d07db369b81700aded8.poster.avif?t=1746425347\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568000/extras/591e7ad78b957d07db369b81700aded8.webm?t=1746425347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568000/extras/591e7ad78b957d07db369b81700aded8.mp4?t=1746425347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay revolves around strategic card battles. In each battle, you can summon powerful minions to fight for you using the cards in your hand or enhance their abilities with upgrade cards to pose a greater threat to the enemy. Within a limited number of turns, you must plan each move carefully and make optimal use of every energy point to defeat your opponent. If the turns run out and the enemy is still standing, the challenge will be declared a failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568000/extras/a670cb7044a7a3c346991d44049b5395.poster.avif?t=1746425347\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568000/extras/a670cb7044a7a3c346991d44049b5395.webm?t=1746425347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568000/extras/a670cb7044a7a3c346991d44049b5395.mp4?t=1746425347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the battle, you will earn a certain amount of gold based on your performance. When shopping at the store, every decision requires caution. Whether you choose to save up and accumulate interest, or take a gamble and spend gold to refresh the store inventory, the choice is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568000/extras/b2207d1b78083c5586d1aac06cde9c11.poster.avif?t=1746425347\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568000/extras/b2207d1b78083c5586d1aac06cde9c11.webm?t=1746425347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568000/extras/b2207d1b78083c5586d1aac06cde9c11.mp4?t=1746425347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During gameplay, there are over 100 cards and 30 relics with different effects, offering a rich deck-building experience. By combining card effects, you can achieve synergies where the result is greater than the sum of its parts. The interplay between relics and cards can further enhance the potential of specific playstyles.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Welcome to *Lucky Summoner*, a strategy card battle game that blends deck-building with RogueLite elements. Here, you'll play as a fledgling card summoner, skillfully utilizing the cards in your hand to defeat increasingly powerful enemies. Overcome the final BOSS's challenge to earn the title of Summoning Master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Introduction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568000/extras/591e7ad78b957d07db369b81700aded8.poster.avif?t=1746425347\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568000/extras/591e7ad78b957d07db369b81700aded8.webm?t=1746425347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568000/extras/591e7ad78b957d07db369b81700aded8.mp4?t=1746425347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay revolves around strategic card battles. In each battle, you can summon powerful minions to fight for you using the cards in your hand or enhance their abilities with upgrade cards to pose a greater threat to the enemy. Within a limited number of turns, you must plan each move carefully and make optimal use of every energy point to defeat your opponent. If the turns run out and the enemy is still standing, the challenge will be declared a failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568000/extras/a670cb7044a7a3c346991d44049b5395.poster.avif?t=1746425347\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568000/extras/a670cb7044a7a3c346991d44049b5395.webm?t=1746425347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568000/extras/a670cb7044a7a3c346991d44049b5395.mp4?t=1746425347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the battle, you will earn a certain amount of gold based on your performance. When shopping at the store, every decision requires caution. Whether you choose to save up and accumulate interest, or take a gamble and spend gold to refresh the store inventory, the choice is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568000/extras/b2207d1b78083c5586d1aac06cde9c11.poster.avif?t=1746425347\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568000/extras/b2207d1b78083c5586d1aac06cde9c11.webm?t=1746425347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568000/extras/b2207d1b78083c5586d1aac06cde9c11.mp4?t=1746425347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During gameplay, there are over 100 cards and 30 relics with different effects, offering a rich deck-building experience. By combining card effects, you can achieve synergies where the result is greater than the sum of its parts. The interplay between relics and cards can further enhance the potential of specific playstyles.</p>",
    "short_description": "Lucky Summoner is a deck-building Roguelite strategy card game. In each battle, you will use cards to summon minions, strengthen them, and defeat enemies within a limited number of turns to claim victory. You can purchase powerful cards and relics after battles to enhance the strength of your deck.",
